@node Reading This Manual
@section Reading This Manual
@cindex manual organization
@cindex reading the manual

The manual is organized by task.  New users should read @ref{Installation
and Requirements} and @ref{Getting Started} first, then @ref{Issue
Workflow}.  The remaining task chapters --- @ref{Dashboards and Views},
@ref{Formulas Molecules and Epics}, @ref{Agents and Sling},
@ref{Orchestration and Terminal}, and @ref{Maintenance and Extending}
--- cover the rest of the day-to-day and administrative surface.

@ref{Command and Variable Reference} is the lookup chapter for individual
commands and user options; @ref{Concepts} defines the data-model
vocabulary the rest of the manual uses.  The @ref{Key Index} and the
@ref{Command and Variable Index} close the manual.

